&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Regional Account Executive with 8 to 10 years of experience in enterprise Public Sector SaaS sales. This level of experience is critical given the complexity of government procurement cycles, multi stakeholder sales processes, and the responsibility of independently managing a statewide territory.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
