&lt;p&gt;We have immediate opportunities on our Transition Team for Licensed Practical Nurses / LPNs interested in helping infants, children, and adults receive complex care at home throughout Chester County, Delaware County and Montgomery County! The role is &lt;strong&gt;FT – 40 hours per week. &lt;/strong&gt;This team will support the transition of care from the hospital team to ongoing home care services. This role offers a unique opportunity to learn how to care for clients with rare and complex diseases. &amp;nbsp;As part of the Transition Team, you will be responsible for delivering quality care to clients and providing extensive training to the ongoing care team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Present openings are day shifts (Monday through Sunday) and overnight shifts (Monday through Sunday). You choose which shift works best for you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 9, 47); text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supported by a team dedicated to your success, our Transition Team Licensed Practical Nurses / LPNs enjoy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Weekly pay&lt;br&gt;Hourly position (competitive hourly rate dependent upon availability and commitment)&lt;br&gt;Day and overnight options&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Comprehensive medical benefits&lt;br&gt;Paid, industry-leading training&lt;br&gt;Scholarship programs and tuition reimbursement&lt;br&gt;401(k) with company match&lt;br&gt;Tools needed for your job – we invest in our care team&lt;br&gt;A positive and stable working environment with a supportive office team&lt;br&gt;Certifications to advance your skills&lt;br&gt;Employee referral bonuses for referring your friends &amp;amp; family to BAYADA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(204, 9, 47);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications for Transition Team Licensed Practical Nurses / LPNs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
