&lt;p data-start=&quot;386&quot; data-end=&quot;602&quot;&gt;We are currently seeking experienced and dedicated&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;469&quot; data-end=&quot;505&quot;&gt;Licensed Practical Nurses (LPNs)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team in providing in-home nursing care for an 18-year-old client in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;586&quot; data-end=&quot;601&quot;&gt;Beverly, NJ&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;386&quot; data-end=&quot;602&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This client has overnight shifts open!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;604&quot; data-end=&quot;876&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;604&quot; data-end=&quot;624&quot;&gt;Client Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This client is a bright and resilient young woman with complex medical needs. She is non-verbal, non-ambulatory, and has global developmental delays. She requires skilled nursing support to help her live safely and comfortably in her home environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ba372a;&quot;&gt;Come for the Flexibility,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #ba372a;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.bayada.com/the-bayada-way.asp&quot;&gt;Stay for the Culture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care was founded on the principle that health care gets better when clients get better care at home—the place they most want to be.&amp;nbsp; Delivering care is our highest priority and greatest joy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We care for people of all ages, diagnoses, and acuity levels, giving you the chance to explore and put your skills to work. Many clients require advanced care such as tracheostomy and ventilator management. We offer paid training to prepare you for the unique and rewarding environment you will provide care in, prioritizing your skillset confidence and knowledge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA is hiring licensed practical nurses to work with our adult and pediatric clients in Burlington County. If are interested in learning more about LPN opportunities at BAYADA, please apply to this posting.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(186, 55, 42);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications for a BAYADA nurse:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Valid nursing license in good standing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Current CPR certification&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: #ba372a;&quot;&gt;&lt;sub&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Offers Our LPNs&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One on one care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electronic documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short commute times – we match you with cases near your home&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 on call clinical support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ba372a;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Available LPN Shifts: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
