&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/strong&gt; is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Registered Nurse, RN&lt;/strong&gt; for a full time position with our new Central NJ Senior Living team - a Medicare Certified home health office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This office provides best-in-class care to adult and geriatric clients living in communities that include assisted living, independent living, senior congregate living, 55+ communities, and intermediate care facilities for clients with intellectual disabilities throughout&lt;strong&gt; Somerset, Middlesex and Monmouth Counties&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*This position may also include seeing clients in the traditional home health community setting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
