&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Enjoy being part of a team that cares and a company that believes in leading with our values.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
